## ✅ Smell-Free Pattern

**`addThrowsOnNegativeCount()`** (line 117) is well-written:
- Uses `assertThrows` idiomatically
- Asserts on the exception message
- Tests exactly one behaviour
- No magic numbers, no external dependencies

This is the model to follow.

